@startuml
|Coordinator|
start
:Identify student needing transfer;
:Select target program;
:Submit transition request with reason;

|Director|
:Review request;
if (Approve?) then (Yes)
  :Approve program move;
else (No)
  :Reject request;
  stop
endif

|System|
:Create transition record;
:Update student's current program;
:Log to audit trail;
stop
@enduml
